  "title": "packaging: For Debian/Ubuntu add dependency to qt6-qpa-plugins",
  "description": "qt6-qpa-plugin is no longer default included with qt6-base package\n(as qt5-base), but it's included in qt6-base-dev used when building\n\n```\n  ** (wireshark:52894) 16:57:26.506343 [GUI WARNING] -- Could not find the Qt platform plugin \"xcb\" in \"\"\n  ** (wireshark:52894) 16:57:26.506365 [GUI ERROR] -- This application failed to start because no Qt platform plugin could be initialized. Reinstalling the application may fix this problem.\n\n  ** (wireshark:52894) Aborting on fatal log level exception\n```\n\nAdding dependency will make sure apt install needed plugins",
