        {
          "id": 2255047180,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "This seems to have become a bigger problem for applications moving to Qt6, google the fault above seems to be reaccuring for many. Maybe Debian/Ubuntu could change `libqt6gui6` to depend on `qt6-qpa-plugins` instead of just recommend?",
          "author": {
            "id": 6524193,
            "username": "oakimk",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Joakim Karlsson",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/6524193/avatar.png?v=1787702414",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/oakimk"
          },
          "created_at": "2024-12-12T09:21:10.857Z",
          "updated_at": "2024-12-12T17:26:24.770Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 348592711,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": true,
          "resolved_by": {
            "id": 7384671,
            "username": "rbalint",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Balint Reczey",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3dff6a01e100a1b24a9d11cb0328f45b04c323c72058516e1e855106a993206b?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/rbalint"
          },
          "resolved_at": "2024-12-12T17:26:24.770Z",
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 18391,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 2256217436,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Indeed, I've opened a bug for that in Debian:\nhttps://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1089793\n\nHaving a strong dependency on `qt6-qpa-plugins` should prevent such issues. We still need this change here, because `libqt6gui6`'s dependency change is unlikely to be backported.\n\nAs a side note `libqt6gui6` already recommend `qt6-qpa-plugins`, thus someone somewhere did not install recommends on the affected systems, thus asked for potential problems. The current `Recommends` relationship is accurate, while not pleasant for a small subset of adventurous end users.",
          "author": {
            "id": 7384671,
            "username": "rbalint",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Balint Reczey",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3dff6a01e100a1b24a9d11cb0328f45b04c323c72058516e1e855106a993206b?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/rbalint"
          },
          "created_at": "2024-12-12T16:58:04.674Z",
          "updated_at": "2024-12-12T17:26:24.770Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 348592711,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": true,
