          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "BTW I can't test it because I don't have VirtualBox on my machines at the moment, but it seems your VirtualBox comes with the VNC extension, thus Qt6 tries the VNC plugin there, too: https://forums.virtualbox.org/viewtopic.php?t=107948",
